Herald.OSS is the upstream open-source distribution of the Herald
structured-logging core for .NET. Herald.Core, the canonical
MMPWorks distribution at https://github.com/mmpworks/Herald.Core,
extends this upstream with edition-gating machinery (Pro and
Enterprise capability checks, provenance gating, distribution
hardening) layered on top of the same kernel + pipeline.

