Disclaimers
----------------------------------------------------------------------

Herald.OSS includes an opt-in external event injection capability,
enabled by AllowExternalEventInjection(). When an application enables
it, hand-built events bypass Herald's standard ingest protections,
including redaction, and the application is responsible for vetting the
content it injects. See docs/legal/DISCLAIMERS.md for the full
disclosure. This NOTICE points to that document; the canonical text
lives there.

